{"id":"91d04823-e3b1-4fd7-8ba8-20a9fc815923","object":"chat.completion","created":1793244793,"model":"deepseek-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\"thought\":\"Record p43-45 evidence into overview/outlook notes (multi_agent note already updated), covering culture/norms and open-world with exact quotes for later use.\",\"code\":\"write_note(title='outlook', content='补记 p43-45：EvolutionaryAgent（Fig.30）在演化式多智能体对齐中设定初始规范与演化方向，让更守规范的 agent 更易繁殖，策略扩散并稳定成新规范；命名游戏（LLaMa 3、Claude 3.5）显示局部交流可自发形成全局约定，个体看似无偏也会产生集体偏见，少数坚定 LLM 能推动新规范。CASA 基准（基于 WebArena，在线购物与论坛）显示 LLM agent 文化社会意识覆盖不足 10%、违规率超 40%，提示与微调可改善。p44：Society of Mind 启发的四社会模拟（特质与思考模式组合）出现从众与共识；跨国讨论合作中 agent 会因同伴压力从众、丢失人设。§4.3.3 开放世界 agent：用 LLM 生成问题与交互数据以突破训练数据平台期，WebArena 提供电商、论坛、协同开发、CMS 真实网站环境。', evidence_ids=['ev-94c9aed99ffbcdf31b43','ev-bc885ff165a165a4d614','ev-fdbf1c532c2133190b0f'], section='outlook')\"}</｜｜DSML｜｜ parameter>\n</｜｜DSML｜｜ invoke>\n</｜｜DSML｜｜ calls>"},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":8747,"completion_tokens":335,"total_tokens":9082,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":4480},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":4480,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":4267},"system_fingerprint":"bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}